anning","label":"3+ months / exploring"}]},{"id":"result","type":"result","stream":true,"streamEndpoint":"/api/bots/llm-stream","title":"Your next steps","text":"Here is streamed guidance based on your answers (like Typebot’s streaming AI blocks):","items":["Prepare tour questions about staffing, care-level fees, and discharge triggers before you visit.","Do you want to search by location, budget or care levels?","You may also ask to see data on staffing, citations and warnings for facilities."],"cta":{"label":"Search Massachusetts facilities","href":"/search?utm_source=homepage_player&utm_medium=assistant"}}]},"slug":"homepage-ai-assistant"},"__N_SSG":true}}